<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunxiNeural"><bookmark mark="l0"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-2%" pitch="+1%">想象一根长鞭子。手柄<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">只晃了一下</prosody>，鞭梢却甩出<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">很大的幅度</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l0-end"/><break time="180ms"/><bookmark mark="l1"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="0%" pitch="0%">供应链也可能这样：消费者买得<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">还算平稳</prosody>，上游收到的订单却<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">忽高忽低</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l1-end"/><break time="170ms"/><bookmark mark="l2"/><mstts:express-as style="serious" styledegree="0.5"><prosody rate="-2%" pitch="-1%"><prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">不是每条供应链</prosody>都会放大，但只盯着自己的订单，很容易看错<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">真实需求</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l2-end"/></voice></speak>